1
00:02:48,402 --> 00:02:50,938
Yaaaaaah!

2
00:03:25,873 --> 00:03:28,776
50 years have passed,

3
00:03:28,809 --> 00:03:33,881
but I do not age.

4
00:03:33,914 --> 00:03:39,753
Time has lost its effect on me.

5
00:03:43,657 --> 00:03:47,495
Yet the suffering
continues.

6
00:03:49,062 --> 00:03:51,765
Aku's grasp chokes the past,

7
00:03:51,799 --> 00:03:55,369
present, and future.

8
00:03:55,403 --> 00:03:59,106
Hope is lost.

9
00:03:59,139 --> 00:04:01,475
Gotta get back,

10
00:04:01,509 --> 00:04:03,444
back to the past.

11
00:04:03,477 --> 00:04:05,313
Samurai Jack.

12
00:04:17,591 --> 00:04:27,801
Aaaaaaaakuuuuuuuuuu.

13
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:23,557
Seven daughters
to do your bidding, Master.

14
00:05:23,591 --> 00:05:27,395
They will succeed where
so many others have failed,

15
00:05:27,428 --> 00:05:32,600
and we will find favor
in your glory.

16
00:07:48,902 --> 00:07:50,470
Why?

17
00:07:50,504 --> 00:07:52,439
Why?

18
00:07:52,472 --> 00:07:55,042
Why have you forsaken us?

19
00:07:55,075 --> 00:07:58,646
Have you forgotten,
my son?

20
00:07:58,679 --> 00:08:00,514
No. No.

21
00:08:03,584 --> 00:08:05,218
Help!

22
00:08:05,252 --> 00:08:08,055
Help me, son!
You must!

23
00:08:08,088 --> 00:08:11,725
Son,
you are forgetting us!

24
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:13,060
No.

25
00:08:13,093 --> 00:08:17,364
You --
You never came back.

26
00:08:21,168 --> 00:08:23,336
You left us.

27
00:08:23,370 --> 00:08:26,206
You abandoned
your purpose.

28
00:08:26,239 --> 00:08:27,675
I haven't!

29
00:08:27,708 --> 00:08:30,678
You left us all to...

30
00:08:30,711 --> 00:08:33,213
Die!

31
00:08:39,853 --> 00:08:41,889
Ahh!

32
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:38,679
Son?

33
00:09:42,983 --> 00:09:44,217
Father?

34
00:09:44,251 --> 00:09:45,753
Why?

35
00:09:45,786 --> 00:09:46,754
I -- I --

36
00:09:46,787 --> 00:09:51,992
We've been waiting for you
so long,

37
00:09:52,025 --> 00:09:54,294
but you never came back.

38
00:09:54,327 --> 00:09:57,197
No, Father, Aku destroyed
the way home.

39
00:09:59,199 --> 00:10:01,301
I don't understand!

40
00:10:01,334 --> 00:10:04,638
You were the only one
who could save us!

41
00:10:04,672 --> 00:10:06,006
Father.

42
00:10:06,039 --> 00:10:09,009
He destroyed everything!

43
00:10:09,042 --> 00:10:12,245
Everything is burning!

44
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:15,448
You've forgotten
your purpose!

45
00:10:15,482 --> 00:10:18,351
You've forsaken us!

46
00:10:28,128 --> 00:10:30,798
Ahh!

47
00:10:57,991 --> 00:10:58,892
Ugh!

48
00:10:58,926 --> 00:11:01,561
Any mistake is
certain death,

49
00:11:01,594 --> 00:11:03,964
and death
is our failure.

50
00:11:43,971 --> 00:11:48,341
Bask in the glory of
what our master has created.

51
00:11:48,375 --> 00:11:50,177
Admire its beauty,

52
00:11:50,210 --> 00:11:52,946
but know that the Samurai
is out there

53
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:56,716
leaving a wake of devastation
wherever he goes.

54
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:58,886
That's why, my sweet Ashi,

55
00:11:58,919 --> 00:12:01,889
the daughters of Aku
must stay focused,

56
00:12:01,922 --> 00:12:05,692
never relent,
always attack.

57
00:12:05,725 --> 00:12:07,594
Teach this one
a lesson.

58
00:12:19,639 --> 00:12:21,474
Stop!

59
00:12:21,508 --> 00:12:24,611
The weak
have no place with Aku.

60
00:12:34,354 --> 00:12:35,455
Are you weak?

61
00:12:39,092 --> 00:12:40,560
Are you weak?

62
00:12:44,297 --> 00:12:46,266
Are you weak?!

63
00:12:46,299 --> 00:12:48,268
Ahh!

64
00:12:50,637 --> 00:12:52,105
Yes.

65
00:12:52,139 --> 00:12:57,110
Aku's fire stirs
inside all of you.

66
00:12:58,678 --> 00:13:00,513
To defeat the one,

67
00:13:00,547 --> 00:13:03,283
your senses must be sharp.

68
00:13:09,522 --> 00:13:11,758
Their time is almost at hand.

69
00:13:11,791 --> 00:13:13,493
Once they succeed,

70
00:13:13,526 --> 00:13:17,030
you will again honor us
with your presence.

71
00:14:08,515 --> 00:14:11,151
Samurai Jack!

72
00:14:11,184 --> 00:14:14,054
Man, it is good to see you,
babe.

73
00:14:14,087 --> 00:14:15,555
What took you so long?

74
00:14:15,588 --> 00:14:17,824
I decimated this village
days ago

75
00:14:17,857 --> 00:14:20,260
just for you.

76
00:14:20,293 --> 00:14:22,062
Oh, wait.
This is you, right?

77
00:14:22,095 --> 00:14:23,830
I mean,
who could recognize you

78
00:14:23,863 --> 00:14:27,834
with all that gear
and ruggedness, baby?

79
00:14:27,867 --> 00:14:29,736
I'll tell you who --
me.

80
00:14:31,404 --> 00:14:34,174
Scaramouch the Merciless,

81
00:14:34,207 --> 00:14:38,178
the Pied Piper of Ruination,
the Crooner of Carnage,

82
00:14:38,211 --> 00:14:43,616
the Ambassador of Annihilation,
the Eradicator of All, baby.

83
00:14:43,650 --> 00:14:47,820
Also known as Aku's
most favorite assassin, babe.

84
00:14:48,989 --> 00:14:53,426
Oh, there it is, babe,
the world-famous scowl.

85
00:14:53,460 --> 00:14:56,229
Well, come on, Sammy, baby.
Whip it out.

86
00:14:56,263 --> 00:14:57,630
You know what
I'm talking about --

87
00:14:57,664 --> 00:14:59,199
that crazy sword.

88
00:14:59,232 --> 00:15:01,935
Let's get slicin' and dicin',
swingin' and bashin',

89
00:15:01,969 --> 00:15:03,870
hackin' and slashin',
babe.

90
00:15:03,903 --> 00:15:06,039
Wait.
Back off, "Beardsly."

91
00:15:06,073 --> 00:15:09,309
Where is your sword,
huh?

92
00:15:09,342 --> 00:15:10,910
I don't see it.

93
00:15:10,944 --> 00:15:13,480
Oh?

94
00:15:13,513 --> 00:15:15,582
No, no, no, no, no,
babe!

95
00:15:15,615 --> 00:15:19,186
Don't tell me
you lost your sword.

96
00:15:29,596 --> 00:15:31,764
Okay, Jacky, baby,
you just make with the scowl

97
00:15:31,798 --> 00:15:34,434
while I make with the phone
and call Aku.

98
00:15:34,467 --> 00:15:36,836
Beep, beep, beep,
bo, dee, do, bip!

99
00:15:38,005 --> 00:15:39,739
Who is this?!

100
00:15:39,772 --> 00:15:42,275
Aku, baby,
how's it hanging, boss?

101
00:15:42,309 --> 00:15:44,177
Guess what I --

102
00:15:46,846 --> 00:15:49,949
What? Hello?!

103
00:15:54,554 --> 00:15:56,523
Ooh,
nice choreography, babe.

104
00:15:56,556 --> 00:15:58,091
You haven't lost a step.

105
00:15:58,125 --> 00:16:00,994
Well, then, let's dance.

106
00:16:55,415 --> 00:16:57,817
You know, babe, I wasn't crazy
about the front scruff,

107
00:16:57,850 --> 00:16:59,819
but I am groovin'
on the mane.

108
00:17:13,366 --> 00:17:14,101
Jack.

109
00:17:14,134 --> 00:17:17,003
Help us, Jack.

110
00:17:18,037 --> 00:17:19,038
Help us.

111
00:17:19,072 --> 00:17:23,276
- Help us!
- Help us, Jack!

112
00:17:24,211 --> 00:17:27,114
Please, no.
You must understand.

113
00:17:27,147 --> 00:17:30,049
That samurai has gone
beaucoup cuckoo.

114
00:18:13,593 --> 00:18:15,562
Hey, you might have destroyed
my magic flute,

115
00:18:15,595 --> 00:18:19,766
but you can't destroy the
musical magic that is me, babe.

116
00:19:18,157 --> 00:19:20,560
Dig that beautiful sound,
baby.

117
00:19:23,196 --> 00:19:26,199
Hey, babe, I told you --
I'm Aku's favorite.

118
00:19:26,233 --> 00:19:28,901
No one plays the blades
like I do.

119
00:19:30,537 --> 00:19:31,671
No one!

120
00:19:47,186 --> 00:19:49,889
Well, it's been fun, Jack-o,
but I got to move on.

121
00:19:49,922 --> 00:19:51,157
Au revoir.

122
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:53,693
That's French for,
"You're dead, babe."

123
00:20:08,441 --> 00:20:11,511
Well, babe, time for me
to shuffle offstage.

124
00:20:11,544 --> 00:20:14,547
Looks like
you're the headliner now.

125
00:20:23,222 --> 00:20:24,724
That's all, babe.

126
00:21:17,844 --> 00:21:19,579
Ashi. Ashi.

127
00:21:29,822 --> 00:21:32,825
Your training is complete.

128
00:21:32,859 --> 00:21:35,328
Go! Kill!

129
00:21:38,365 --> 00:21:40,333
You are seven,

130
00:21:40,367 --> 00:21:43,436
but now you wear
the face of one,

131
00:21:43,470 --> 00:21:47,440
one purpose for which
you were born --

132
00:21:47,474 --> 00:21:50,543
to kill the Samurai!

133
00:21:53,646 --> 00:21:55,482
* Watch out
* Gotta get back

134
00:21:55,515 --> 00:21:57,016
* Back to the past
* Samurai Jack

135
00:21:57,049 --> 00:21:59,218
* Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack
* Wa-Watch out

136
00:22:05,558 --> 00:22:07,126
* Gotta get back,
back to the past, Samurai Jack *

137
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:11,364
* Watch out

138
00:22:11,398 --> 00:22:16,369
* Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack

139
00:22:16,403 --> 00:22:18,137
* Watch out

140
00:22:18,170 --> 00:22:19,238
* Gotta get back

141
00:22:19,271 --> 00:22:20,239
* Jack, Jack, Jack

142
00:22:20,272 --> 00:22:21,808
* Samurai Jack

143
00:22:21,841 --> 00:22:25,412
* Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack, Jack
* Wa-Watch out
